// The offload park (SL:coroutines A3c): it records no deadline and `-1` in
// the park word, as a descriptor park does, then reads the job's completion
// pipe and arms the reactor on it through the same funnel,
// `__saw_exec_io_register`. `offload_wait` is the lane's addition to
// `std.task` (compiler/tests/coro/README.md, "The lane").
import std.task.{offload_wait}

func main() {
    offload_wait(7)
}
